      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 9,
      "end_line": 9,
      "raw": "The weights SHA-256 f5b59a26851551b67ae1fe58d32e76486e1e812def4696a4bea97f16604d40a3 and config Git blob b43183d0f5f0274bccd8054cd0069fc1d5f64586 match the official schnell repository exactly. Only the VAE component is bundled. Model licenses for other FLUX denoisers remain independent. LICENSE contains the Apache-2.0 terms.\n"
